# Root build-context allowlist for deploy/Dockerfile and the separate
# packages/trader-host/Dockerfile.
#
# Docker reads the .dockerignore at the CONTEXT root (the repo root,
# since the Dockerfile COPYs Cargo.toml / crates/ / programs/ from
# there). `deploy/.dockerignore` is NOT applied for a root context, so
# without this file the context would include target/ (~32 GB),
# circuits/ (ptau + zkeys), dstack/, node_modules/, etc.
#
# Allowlist: ignore everything, then re-include only what the
# Dockerfile actually COPYs.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!crates
!programs
!packages
packages/*
!packages/trader-host
packages/trader-host/dist

# N=16 settle-prover artifacts, copied into the runtime image (the
# prover reads /circuits/build/match_batch_n16/). Ladder-include ONLY
# this circuit dir — circuits/ is otherwise excluded so we don't drag in
# pot18 (~288 MB) or the other circuits' zkeys. The zkey is committed;
# circuit.r1cs + circuit_js/circuit.wasm are compiled in CI before the
# build (see .github/workflows/tee-image.yml).
!circuits
circuits/*
!circuits/build
circuits/build/*
!circuits/build/match_batch_n16
# circuit.sym (14 MB) is debug-only — the prover never reads it.
circuits/build/match_batch_n16/circuit.sym
# circuit_cpp/ is the native witness-gen SOURCE (32 MB circuit.cpp + fr.asm).
# The image needs the compiled `circuit` binary AND its `circuit.dat` constants
# (main.cpp loads `<argv[0]>.dat` at runtime). Ship those two, exclude the rest.
circuits/build/match_batch_n16/circuit_cpp/*
!circuits/build/match_batch_n16/circuit_cpp/circuit
!circuits/build/match_batch_n16/circuit_cpp/circuit.dat

# rapidsnark vendored source (the `rapidsnark` prover backend). The
# Dockerfile builds its static libs from this; CI checks it out with
# `submodules: recursive` so the nested deps (ffiasm/json/circom_runtime)
# are present. Exclude any local build dirs — the image builds them fresh.
!third_party
third_party/rapidsnark/build_prover
third_party/rapidsnark/depends/gmp/build*
third_party/rapidsnark/depends/gmp/package*

# Belt-and-suspenders: never ship build artifacts even if a path
# above is widened later.
**/target
**/node_modules
